---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sources"
  description="UniRank data sources — ranking methodology documents, official datasets, and academic references."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-8" style="color:var(--color-ur-ink)">Sources</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p>UniRank analysis is based on publicly available ranking data, methodology documents, and academic research. Individual article pages include specific citations.</p>

      <h2>Ranking Organizations</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>QS World University Rankings</strong> — topuniversities.com · Official methodology and annual data releases</li>
        <li><strong>Times Higher Education (THE)</strong> — timeshighereducation.com · World University Rankings methodology</li>
        <li><strong>ARWU / Shanghai Ranking</strong> — shanghairanking.com · Academic Ranking of World Universities</li>
        <li><strong>U.S. News Global Universities</strong> — usnews.com · Best Global Universities rankings</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Academic Research</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Scientometrics and bibliometrics journals for ranking methodology analysis</li>
        <li>Higher education policy research on ranking effects</li>
        <li>Institutional data from university annual reports and government statistics</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
